==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*krajьnъ}}. {{surf|ru|край|-ний}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|кра́йний}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-крайний.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|кра́йний|adv=кра́йне,на крайня́к,накрайня́к|absn=+}}

# [[outermost]]
# [[extreme]], [[utmost]]
#: {{syn|ru|преде́льный|чрезвыча́йный|необыча́йный}}
# {{lb|ru|euphemistic|colloquial}} [[last]], most [[recent]]
#: {{syn|ru|после́дний|заключи́тельный}}

====Usage notes====
* The word {{m|ru|после́дний}} in the sense of “last, final” may be euphemistically replaced by {{m|ru|кра́йний}} by native speakers who perform dangerous jobs (e.g. pilots, climbers, etc.) due to a superstitious fear of foretelling one's death; {{m|ru|после́дний}} can be seen as connoting “for the last time [in one's life]”.

